IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SHEN-CPU.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PROMPT-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 GEN-TOKENS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-CORES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SHEN-CPU.
    IF NUM-CORES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-CORES TO R14.
    MULTIPLY 25 BY R14.
    MOVE 1850 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    ADD R14 TO SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CORES.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-FACTOR-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
